<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>법률사무소 은오</title>
<script src="https://t1.kakaocdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js"></script>
<style>
  :root{
    --navy:#1b2a4a;
    --navy-2:#2c3e63;
    --line:#dfe3ea;
    --bg:#f4f5f7;
    --card:#ffffff;
    --text:#20242c;
    --sub:#6b7280;
    --accent:#c8933f;
    --accent-bg:#fbf3e4;
    --danger:#b3382c;
    --danger-bg:#fbeceb;
    --ok:#1f7a4d;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:"Pretendard","Malgun Gothic","Apple SD Gothic Neo",sans-serif;
    background:var(--bg);
    color:var(--text);
    line-height:1.5;
  }
  .topbar{
    background:var(--navy);
    color:#fff;
    padding:16px 24px;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    gap:10px;
  }
  .topbar h1{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;margin:0;}
  .topbar .sub{font-size:12px;color:#c7cee0;margin-top:2px;}
  .topbar-actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn{
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:#fff;
    color:var(--text);
    padding:8px 14px;
    border-radius:6px;
    font-size:13px;
    cursor:pointer;
    font-weight:500;
  }
  .btn:hover{background:#f0f1f3;}
  .btn-dark{background:var(--navy-2);color:#fff;border-color:var(--navy-2);}
  .btn-dark:hover{background:var(--navy);}
  .btn-danger{color:var(--danger);border-color:#ecc; }
  .btn-danger:hover{background:var(--danger-bg);}
  .btn-sm{padding:5px 10px;font-size:12px;}

  .wrap{max-width:1560px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 24px 60px;}

  .coin-panel{
    margin-top:10px;padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #f0d47a;border-radius:8px;
    background:#fff8e6;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 20px;font-size:13px;color:#7a5c00;
  }
  .coin-panel strong{font-size:14px;}
  #remaining-coin.coin-ok{color:var(--ok);}
  #remaining-coin.coin-over{color:var(--danger);}
  .procedure-toggle{
    display:flex;gap:0;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;width:fit-content;margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .procedure-toggle button{
    padding:8px 20px;border:none;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--sub);
  }
  .procedure-toggle button.active{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;}

  .card{
    background:var(--card);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:8px;
    padding:20px 22px;
    margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .card h2{
    font-size:14px;
    font-weight:600;
    margin:0 0 14px;
    padding-bottom:10px;
    border-bottom:2px solid var(--navy);
    color:var(--navy);
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
  }
  .card h2 .badge{
    font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:var(--sub);border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;
  }

  .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:14px;}
  .grid.g2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
  .field label{
    display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--sub);margin-bottom:5px;font-weight:500;
  }
  .field input, .field select{
    width:100%;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:5px;
    font-size:13px;background:#fbfbfc;font-family:inherit;color:var(--text);
  }
  .field input:focus, .field select:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--navy-2);background:#fff;}
  .field.wide{grid-column:span 2;}
  .field.full{grid-column:1/-1;}

  table.debt-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13.5px;}
  table.debt-table th{
    background:#f5f6f8;color:var(--sub);font-weight:600;font-size:12px;
    padding:9px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;
  }
  table.debt-table td{
    padding:6px 8px;border-bottom:1px solid #eceef1;vertical-align:middle;
  }
  table.debt-table input, table.debt-table select{
    width:100%;border:1px solid transparent;background:transparent;padding:8px 7px;
    font-size:13.5px;border-radius:4px;font-family:inherit;color:var(--text);
  }
  table.debt-table input:focus, table.debt-table select:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--navy-2);background:#fff;}
  input.date-error{border-color:var(--danger) !important;background:var(--danger-bg) !important;color:var(--danger);}
  table.debt-table input.num{text-align:right;}
  table.debt-table td.readonly{color:var(--sub);font-size:13px;}
  table.debt-table td.rownum{color:var(--sub);text-align:center;width:44px;}
  .del-row{
    background:none;border:none;color:var(--danger);cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;padding:4px;
  }
  .del-row:hover{opacity:0.7;}
  .mortgage-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px;}
  .mortgage-chip{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;background:var(--accent-bg);color:var(--accent);
    border:1px solid #e6d3ac;border-radius:12px;padding:2px 6px 2px 8px;font-size:11.5px;white-space:nowrap;
  }
  .chip-remove{border:none;background:none;color:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;font-size:11px;padding:0;line-height:1;}
  .chip-remove:hover{color:var(--danger);}

  .drag-handle{
    cursor:grab;color:var(--sub);font-size:13px;user-select:none;padding:2px 3px;
  }
  .drag-handle:active{cursor:grabbing;}
  tr.child-row td:nth-child(2){border-left:2px solid var(--navy-2);padding-left:14px;}
  #debtBody tr.drop-before{box-shadow:inset 0 2px 0 0 var(--navy-2);}
  #debtBody tr.drop-after{box-shadow:inset 0 -2px 0 0 var(--navy-2);}
  #debtBody tr.drop-nest{background:var(--accent-bg);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--accent);}

  .modal-overlay{
    display:none;position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(20,24,34,0.45);
    align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:100;padding:20px;
  }
  .modal-overlay.open{display:flex;}
  .modal-box{
    background:#fff;border-radius:10px;width:100%;max-width:520px;max-height:85vh;
    display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;
  }
  .modal-header{
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
    padding:16px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .modal-header h3{margin:0;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);}
  .modal-close{border:none;background:none;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--sub);padding:4px;}
  .modal-body{padding:16px 20px;overflow-y:auto;}
  .modal-divider{height:1px;background:var(--line);margin:14px 0;}
  .modal-results{max-height:180px;overflow-y:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;display:none;}
  .modal-results.show{display:block;}
  .modal-result-item{
    padding:8px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12.5px;border-bottom:1px solid #f0f1f3;
  }
  .modal-result-item:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  .modal-result-item:hover{background:var(--bg);}
  .modal-result-item .rname{font-weight:500;color:var(--text);}
  .modal-result-item .raddr{color:var(--sub);font-size:11.5px;margin-top:2px;}
  .modal-footer{
    display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px;padding:14px 20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .table-actions{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;}

  .summary-strip{
    display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:2px;
  }
  .summary-strip .box{
    background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:12px 14px;
  }
  .summary-strip .box .label{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--sub);margin-bottom:4px;}
  .summary-strip .box .value{font-size:17px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);}
  .summary-strip .box.flag .value{color:var(--danger);}

  .note{
    font-size:11.5px;color:var(--sub);margin-top:8px;line-height:1.6;
  }
  .save-status{font-size:12px;color:var(--sub);}
  .save-status.saved{color:var(--ok);}

  .tabs{
    display:flex;gap:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .tabs button{
    padding:10px 18px;border:none;background:none;cursor:pointer;
    font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--sub);
    border-bottom:2px solid transparent;margin-bottom:-1px;
  }
  .tabs button.active{color:var(--navy);border-bottom-color:var(--navy);}
  .tab-panel{display:none;}
  .tab-panel.active{display:block;}

  @media(max-width:720px){
    .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .grid.g2{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .summary-strip{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div>
    <h1>사건 인적사항 · 부채작성</h1>
    <div class="sub">법률사무소 은오 · 개인회생/파산 사건 데이터 입력</div>
  </div>
  <div class="topbar-actions">
    <span class="save-status" id="saveStatus">저장됨</span>
    <button class="btn btn-sm" id="btnExport">JSON 내보내기</button>
    <button class="btn btn-sm" id="btnImport">JSON 불러오기</button>
    <input type="file" id="fileImport" accept="application/json" style="display:none;">
    <button class="btn btn-sm btn-danger" id="btnReset">초기화</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap">

  <div class="procedure-toggle" id="procedureToggle">
    <button data-val="회생" class="active">개인회생</button>
    <button data-val="파산">개인파산</button>
  </div>

  <div class="tabs" id="tabs">
    <button data-tab="case">사건정보</button>
    <button data-tab="basic" class="active">인적사항</button>
    <button data-tab="creditors">채권자목록 <span class="badge" id="tabCreditorCount">0건</span></button>
    <button data-tab="assets">재산목록</button>
    <button data-tab="income">수입·지출</button>
    <button data-tab="statement">진술서</button>
    <button data-tab="repayment">변제계획안</button>
  </div>

  <div class="tab-panel" id="panel-case">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>사건 기본정보</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="field">
          <label>관할법원</label>
          <input type="text" id="court" placeholder="예: 서울회생법원">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>사건번호</label>
          <input type="text" id="caseNumber" placeholder="예: 2026개회00000">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>재판부</label>
          <input type="text" id="courtDivision" placeholder="예: 제1단독">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <div class="field">
          <label>예금계좌 - 금융기관</label>
          <input type="text" id="bankName" placeholder="예: 국민은행">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>예금계좌 - 계좌번호</label>
          <input type="text" id="bankAccount" placeholder="계좌번호">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <div class="field">
          <label>신청접수일</label>
          <input type="text" id="filingDate" placeholder="26/1/1">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>개시결정일</label>
          <input type="text" id="commencementDate" placeholder="26/1/1">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>인가결정일</label>
          <input type="text" id="confirmationDate" placeholder="26/1/1">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <div class="field">
          <label>서류작성일</label>
          <input type="date" id="draftDate">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>변제시작일</label>
          <input type="date" id="repayStartDate">
          <div class="note" id="repayStartHint" style="margin-top:4px;"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="grid" style="margin-top:14px;">
        <div class="field">
          <label>변제금 납입계좌 - 은행</label>
          <input type="text" id="repayBankName" placeholder="예: 신한은행">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>변제금 납입계좌 - 계좌번호</label>
          <input type="text" id="repayBankAccount" placeholder="계좌번호">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tab-panel active" id="panel-basic">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>인적사항</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="field">
          <label>성명</label>
          <input type="text" id="debtorName" placeholder="채무자 성명">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>주민등록번호</label>
          <input type="text" id="debtorRRN" placeholder="000000-0000000">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>휴대전화</label>
          <input type="text" id="debtorPhone" placeholder="010-0000-0000">
        </div>
        <div class="field wide">
          <label>주민등록상 주소</label>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:6px;">
            <input type="text" id="debtorRegAddr" placeholder="주민등록상 주소" style="flex:1;">
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm" id="btnPostcode" style="flex-shrink:0;">우편번호 검색</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>우편번호</label>
          <input type="text" id="debtorZip" placeholder="00000">
        </div>
        <div class="field wide">
          <label>현 거주지</label>
          <input type="text" id="debtorCurrentAddr" placeholder="실제 거주지 주소">
        </div>
        <div class="field" style="display:flex;align-items:flex-end;">
          <label style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text);margin-bottom:9px;cursor:pointer;">
            <input type="checkbox" id="sameAddr" style="width:auto;">
            주민등록상 주소와 동일(상동)
          </label>
        </div>
      </div>

      <details id="housingDetails" style="margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:14px;">
        <summary style="cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);">
          거주지 상세내역 <span class="badge" id="housingCount">0건</span> <span style="font-weight:400;color:var(--sub);font-size:11.5px;">(클릭하여 펼치기/접기)</span>
        </summary>
        <div style="margin-top:12px;">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;margin-bottom:8px;">
            <button class="btn btn-sm" id="btnPrintHousing" type="button">거주정보 인쇄</button>
          </div>
          <div style="overflow-x:auto;">
            <table class="debt-table" id="housingTable">
              <thead>
                <tr>
                  <th style="width:30px;"></th>
                  <th style="width:40px;">#</th>
                  <th style="width:70px;">현재거주</th>
                  <th style="min-width:200px;">주소</th>
                  <th style="width:100px;">우편번호</th>
                  <th style="width:100px;">거주형태</th>
                  <th style="width:120px;">보증금</th>
                  <th style="width:110px;">월 차임료</th>
                  <th style="width:120px;">거주 시작일</th>
                  <th style="width:120px;">거주 종료일</th>
                  <th style="min-width:110px;">비고</th>
                  <th style="width:40px;"></th>
                </tr>
              </thead>
              <tbody id="housingBody"></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <div class="table-actions">
            <button class="btn btn-sm" id="btnAddHousing">+ 거주정보 추가</button>
            <div class="note">위쪽 "주민등록상 주소/현 거주지"는 서류에 바로 쓰이는 요약 정보이고, 여기는 보정 대응용 상세 이력(5년치 등)입니다. 두 곳은 서로 자동 연동되지 않으니 각각 입력해주세요. 거주 종료일을 비워두면 "현재까지"로 인쇄됩니다. 순서는 ⠿ 아이콘을 끌어서 바꿀 수 있습니다.</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>가족관계</h2>
      <div style="font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:8px;">가족구성원 <span class="badge" id="familyCount">0건</span></div>
      <div style="overflow-x:auto;">
        <table class="debt-table" id="familyTable">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th style="width:40px;">#</th>
              <th style="width:100px;">관계</th>
              <th style="min-width:110px;">성명</th>
              <th style="width:130px;">생년월일</th>
              <th style="min-width:100px;">직업</th>
              <th style="width:90px;">동거기간</th>
              <th style="width:40px;"></th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody id="familyBody"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div class="table-actions">
        <button class="btn btn-sm" id="btnAddFamily">+ 가족 추가</button>
        <div class="note">동거여부·부양여부는 수입·지출 탭에서 설정합니다. 여기 입력한 가족은 수입·지출 탭(가구원수 등)과 보험현황(배우자 보험)에서 그대로 활용됩니다.</div>
      </div>

      <div style="height:1px;background:var(--line);margin:18px 0;"></div>

      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;">
        <div style="font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);">혼인이력 <span class="badge" id="marriageCount">0건</span></div>
        <button class="btn btn-sm" id="btnOpenMarriageModal" type="button">혼인이력 관리</button>
      </div>
      <div class="note" style="margin-top:6px;">혼인·이혼·재혼·사별 이력은 별도 창에서 입력합니다.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="tab-panel" id="panel-creditors">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>
        <span>채권목록</span>
        <span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;">
          <button class="btn btn-sm" id="btnPrintPreview" type="button">인쇄 미리보기</button>
          <button class="btn btn-sm" id="btnExportCSV" type="button">전자소송 CSV 다운로드</button>
          <span class="badge" id="creditorCount">0건</span>
        </span>
      </h2>
